flowchart TD
    Run["GoogleADKAdapter.run"] --> Runner["Resolve and validate real Runner or factory result"]
    Runner --> State["Map candidate to initial session state"]
    State --> Session["Create isolated session"]
    Session --> Events["Consume Runner.run_async events"]
    Events --> Usage["Capture tokens and final response"]
    Usage --> Output["Map final event to evaluation output"]
    Output --> Cleanup["Finally: close event stream and delete temporary session"]
    Events -->|Failure or cancellation| Cleanup
    Cleanup --> Result["Return output and usage, or propagate failure to optimizer"]
